PRIVACY POLICY & DATA COLLECTION

Last Updated: 2026-05-29

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

During the installation and operation of Mini-B, we collect the following information:

• Installation status (successful/completed)
• Host IP address
• Serial number (HostSn) of the installation
• Operating system version
• PHP version
• Product package version

2. PURPOSE OF DATA COLLECTION

The collected information is used exclusively for:

• Analytics and statistical purposes
• Service interaction and update management
• Improving product quality and user experience
• Providing timely security updates and notifications

3. DATA STORAGE AND RETENTION

• We do not store any personal user data
• Only technical installation data is collected
• All collected data is anonymized where possible
• Data is retained for the operational period of the service

4. WHAT WE DO NOT COLLECT

We explicitly DO NOT collect or store:

• User personal information (names, addresses, phone numbers)
• User credentials (passwords, API keys)
• File contents stored in buckets
• Database content
• Any sensitive personal data
• Payment or financial information
• Browsing history or user behavior tracking

5. DATA SHARING

• We do not sell, trade, or rent your information to third parties
• Data is used internally for product improvement only
• Aggregated statistics may be shared but will never identify individual installations

6. DATA SECURITY

• All data transmissions are encrypted
• Access to collected data is restricted to authorized personnel only
• Regular security audits are performed

7. YOUR RIGHTS

You have the right to:
• Request deletion of your installation data
• Opt-out of analytics collection (by modifying configuration)
• Receive a copy of collected data about your installation

8. CONTACT INFORMATION

For privacy-related questions or data deletion requests, please contact:
Email: sa@itp-corp.ru

9. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY

We may update this privacy policy from time to time. 
Continued use of the software constitutes acceptance of any changes.

10. CONSENT

By completing the installation of Mini-B, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the collection and use of information as described in this Privacy Policy.

